.png", "id": "1257821365412741", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035332_1257821372079407_6599347770036579518_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yQYQntktlowQ7kNvwFiX-xw&_nc_oc=AdkLyKDUB0vTNT8nOSjMx_FZYa6Y5wXo_zQ7D6clCxhFVhq1ZggfHamQeQ5HhmAhlAA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftsAl-FJMWzNVNgJ9suPDEttyj2NJdVBdYaHcS3mGWCJQ&oe=69A6ED5A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "made-in-godot.png", "id": "853716213569126", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031311_853716216902459_2056448508130112580_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=g2k4EyXjTpEQ7kNvwHF_IOe&_nc_oc=AdnXrKZkuSdtpZT1Zw7Jfs8OXcCgMEXhtnF4Dmohd6wKnq8_vc-JPAAeRCl07n3QfzY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftqCW4KiaF0jRAcqtO48cN_VaCcZWEURdGgHompWcFlMg&oe=69A6DF82"}, "display_name": "Godot Game Engine", "keywords": ["Godot", "Productivity", "GameEngine"], "long_description": "The Godot Engine is a free, all-in-one, cross-platform game engine that makes it easy for you to create 2D, 3D and immersive (XR) apps and games.\n\nGodot provides a huge set of common tools, so you can just focus on making your game without reinventing the wheel.\n\nGodot is completely free and open-source under the very permissive MIT license. No strings attached, no royalties, nothing. Your app / game is yours, down to the last line of engine code.", "short_description": "The Godot Engine enables the creation and development of 2D, 3D and XR apps and games natively on Meta Quest devices."}]}, "developer_name": "Godot Foundation", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://godotengine.org/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://godotengine.org/license/", "publisher_name": "Stichting Godot", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://godotengine.org/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "36269